# Trivy waivers for the four image scans in .github/workflows/ci.yml (High and Critical fail the build).
# One waiver per line:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNN  reason: <why it is not exploitable here>  review: <YYYY-MM-DD, at most 90 days out>
# Keep the reason and review date on the same line as the ID.
# A waiver must also be recorded as an accepted finding in docs/security/SECURITY-REVIEW.md. Remove it when the review date passes or the fix lands.
# There are no waivers at the start.
